@startuml
title B — штатный Temporal Workflow
autonumber
participant "Источник" as S
participant "Critical API" as API
database "Delivery Ledger" as DB
participant "Start/Signal Relay" as R
participant "Temporal Service\n+ persistence" as T
participant "Workflow Worker" as W
participant "Activity Worker" as A
participant "Push / приложение" as P
participant "Receipt API" as C
S -> API: событие с event ID
API -> DB: notification + start_outbox; durable COMMIT
DB --> API: t0
API --> S: 202 + notification_id
R -> DB: start_outbox
R -> T: StartWorkflow(workflow_id = notification_id)
T --> R: started / AlreadyStarted
R -> DB: отметить start
W -> T: poll Workflow Task
T --> W: history
W -> T: schedule Send Activity + deadline
A -> T: poll Activity Task
T --> A: attempt_id + payload reference
A -> DB: policy reference + reserve attempt; success guard
A -> P: push(attempt_id)
P --> A: принято
A -> DB: факт ACCEPTED
A -> T: Activity result
P -> C: app receipt
C -> DB: receipt + signal_outbox; COMMIT
C --> P: 2xx
R -> DB: signal_outbox
R -> T: Signal(receipt_id)
T --> R: durable accepted
R -> DB: отметить signal
T -> W: Workflow Task с receipt
W -> T: dedup receipt; завершить DELIVERED
note over A,DB: SQL защищает внешние эффекты; workflow владеет процессом
@enduml
